{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o036a","title":"刘备入益州与刘璋会涪","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o036a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备留诸葛亮、关羽据荆州，率步卒入益州，与刘璋在涪相会。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q"]},{"id":"liuermu-a-979b0d5292834047fafb","label":"正文","text":"刘备至江州诣涪","evidence":["liuermu-q-f5a19800b02708db6cc6"]},{"id":"liuermu-a-33ecc5481ce930645fdf","label":"正文","text":"刘璋率步骑三万会刘备","evidence":["liuermu-q-285d180609591d54248a"]},{"id":"duzhou-a-e93ca3f6ee414319d769","label":"正文","text":"刘备张裕涪会互嘲","evidence":["duzhou-q-8330e1750221cc63d84f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"入蜀","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"迎接","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"留守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"留守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"dengzhang-p0023","role":"以潞涿君之语反嘲刘备无须","evidence":["duzhou-q-8330e1750221cc63d84f"]}],"place":{"text":"涪","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q"]},"time":{"year":211,"label":"建安十六年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y211","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o034","basis":"建安十六年"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036a-q","xianzhu-q-o034","xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75"]},"source_order":[32,162,"O036a"],"order":6472}],"persons":[{"id":"dengzhang-p0023","name":"张裕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0253","name":"刘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"duzhou-q-8330e1750221cc63d84f","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-5486ef9fd9f979995eb5","layer":"original","quote":"初，先主与刘璋会涪时，裕为璋从事，侍坐。其人饶须，先主嘲之曰：“昔吾居家涿县〖12〗，特多毛姓；东西南北皆诸毛也。涿令称曰‘诸毛绕涿居乎〖13〗’？”裕即答曰：“昔有作上党潞长〖14〗，迁为涿令者，去官还家。时人与书，欲署‘潞’则失‘涿’，欲署‘涿’则失‘潞’，乃署曰‘潞涿君〖15〗’。”先主无须，故裕以此及之","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-285d180609591d54248a","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-cd2715048d75eb8ace1d","layer":"original","quote":"璋率步骑三万余人，车乘帐幔，精光曜日，往就与会。先主所将将士，更相之适〖23〗，欢饮百余日","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-f5a19800b02708db6cc6","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-cd2715048d75eb8ace1d","layer":"original","quote":"先主至江州〖21〗，北由垫江水，﹝五﹞诣涪〖22〗；﹝六﹞去成都三百六十里，是岁建安十六年也","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-0e5a4f9cc0d9229b2789","layer":"original","quote":"先主留诸葛亮、关羽等据荆州；将步卒数万人入益州。至涪，璋自出迎，相见甚欢。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
